{"id":"vod_sn_38749","vodId":"38749","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天元突破红莲螺岩","name_cn":"天元突破红莲螺岩","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/aa345bb4e7f68862191cf5c38bebac42.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个被命运背叛的男人，战斗、继续战斗、不断战斗的热血故事。　　日复一日，地下村庄基哈村的少年西蒙始终拿着钻头挖掘，并习以为常。但是，西蒙的好友，被称为“大哥”的卡米那终日叫嚣着所谓地上的世界。“穿破天际，到地上的世界去看一看吧”卡米那每日这样想着。但一直未能成功。直到一天，巨大的机械怪物——“颜面”打破村子的天井，进入村子破坏。确认了地上世界的存在，卡米那热情高涨，与地上来的少女优子、小弟西蒙三人一起对抗颜面，并驾驶西蒙意外挖出的机械——“裸眼”冲出了天井，达到了地上的世界！　　地球表面展现在少年少女面前，但其实地表上有更多的“颜面”，不断战斗的冒险故事就此展开。西蒙的未来，以任何人都无法想象的方向展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":27,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7bjHXkG7qT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zfvzZL6Gm21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xGiaQbqrt11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8bTk3isJZ91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hqVHzjGAte1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4pRW6Ga8fi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bacbhMQTR01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K0sa5wKvn01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3WivM2Aya41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wKVTG0tmTt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aJKwj5XrjM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wdSb5M1H511/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0Aa4aJsED91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JJpChmsHcM1/video